{"3510640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terra Trials", "steam_appid": 3510640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the brutal and unpredictable world of a reality show, where every step could be your last!</strong><br>Set in a distant future, you are an ordinary person who decided to take part in a show on a planet full of danger. Each participant has their own motivation: earn money, pay off a mortgage, or become famous... Your goal is clear — survive the harsh conditions by enduring deadly trials and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.poster.avif?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.webm?t=1788257586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.mp4?t=1788257586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/dcf7ca9e0663c748f07864b7840105a4.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with minimal resources and the most basic tools. Your mission? Build shelter, gather resources, and survive. Face endless challenges, fight powerful bosses, and live in constant danger. Drones will capture your every move, live broadcasts will stream your actions, and commentators will provide ongoing commentary — and you’ll earn points for every success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll unlock new items and helpers from the show’s organizers by spending the points you’ve earned. Countless quests, challenges, and surprises await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/72d80b6242bcb7b3dd55b14a3397a790.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated planet with various biomes: mountains, forests, deserts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is made up of small blocks in multiple layers, with distinct climates and resources in each area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is either looping or contained by a force field, creating unique exploration dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The changing day-night cycle and seasonal shifts affect gameplay (for example, dangerous enemies appear at night).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/03ed308076451b05d7be1f1ef1b9ef54.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild, alien planet with different biomes and hostile fauna. The world’s design is inspired by the &quot;ant farm&quot; style, with vertical slices that offer both claustrophobic and expansive exploration experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/4d9b0755745c4028539e2ce9dfedd35d.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character by improving skills like strength, accuracy, and craftsmanship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip clothing, armor, and tools to directly impact your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planet, discover or buy blueprints that unlock new crafting options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quests and challenges from show organizers and NPCs — gather resources, battle bosses, and more. In return, earn blueprints, items, and valuable points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>Prepare for an adventure full of danger, unexpected twists, and countless challenges!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the brutal and unpredictable world of a reality show, where every step could be your last!</strong><br>Set in a distant future, you are an ordinary person who decided to take part in a show on a planet full of danger. Each participant has their own motivation: earn money, pay off a mortgage, or become famous... Your goal is clear — survive the harsh conditions by enduring deadly trials and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.poster.avif?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.webm?t=1788257586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/2751158ae2cdf0e139b7be162507245c.mp4?t=1788257586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/dcf7ca9e0663c748f07864b7840105a4.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with minimal resources and the most basic tools. Your mission? Build shelter, gather resources, and survive. Face endless challenges, fight powerful bosses, and live in constant danger. Drones will capture your every move, live broadcasts will stream your actions, and commentators will provide ongoing commentary — and you’ll earn points for every success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll unlock new items and helpers from the show’s organizers by spending the points you’ve earned. Countless quests, challenges, and surprises await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/72d80b6242bcb7b3dd55b14a3397a790.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated planet with various biomes: mountains, forests, deserts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is made up of small blocks in multiple layers, with distinct climates and resources in each area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is either looping or contained by a force field, creating unique exploration dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The changing day-night cycle and seasonal shifts affect gameplay (for example, dangerous enemies appear at night).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/03ed308076451b05d7be1f1ef1b9ef54.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild, alien planet with different biomes and hostile fauna. The world’s design is inspired by the &quot;ant farm&quot; style, with vertical slices that offer both claustrophobic and expansive exploration experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/extras/4d9b0755745c4028539e2ce9dfedd35d.webp?t=1788257586\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character by improving skills like strength, accuracy, and craftsmanship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip clothing, armor, and tools to directly impact your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planet, discover or buy blueprints that unlock new crafting options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quests and challenges from show organizers and NPCs — gather resources, battle bosses, and more. In return, earn blueprints, items, and valuable points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>Prepare for an adventure full of danger, unexpected twists, and countless challenges!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Survive a brutal reality show on a dangerous alien planet! Start with basic tools, build shelter, and face deadly trials and boss battles. Earn points to unlock new items and helpers. Explore, craft, and survive in a procedurally generated world full of threats and surprises!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/0cbe3ca506023a6d709a05988c56e83af7a5b887/header.jpg?t=1788257586", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/8ca6c68b5722851403bcd16ae7c1aad40a6b7952/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788257586", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510640/8ca6c68b5722851403bcd16ae7c1aad40a6b7952/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788257586", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit, Version 21H1 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD Radeo